  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Josie purchased a pass that cost <math alttext=\"dollar sign 19.50\"><mo>$</mo><mn>19.50</mn></math> to tour a nature preserve. She also purchased <math alttext=\"10\"><mn>10</mn></math> identical stickers to give to her nieces and nephews. The pass and the stickers cost <math alttext=\"dollar sign 62.00\"><mo>$</mo><mn>62.00</mn></math> total. What was the cost of one sticker?</p>",
